### My borrowed higher-quality recording equipment

    MixPre-3 preamp and recorder. (This is a discontinued model. The current model is the MixPre-3 II). External power source recommended; four basic AA batteries last only about 45 minutes. Also note that it doesn't have a low-power shutoff, so if batteries run out, the file getting written at that time will be corrupted. User guide PDF.
